<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(b) <U>Second
Closing</U>. The obligation of each Buyer hereunder to purchase its Second Closing Shares at the Second Closing is subject to the satisfaction,
at or before the Second Closing Date, of each of the following conditions, provided that these conditions are for each Buyer&rsquo;s sole
benefit and may be waived by such Buyer at any time in its sole discretion by providing the Company with prior written notice thereof:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(i) The
Company shall have (A) increased its authorized Class A Ordinary Shares to not less than 1,000,000,000 shares (the &ldquo;<B>Authorized
Share Increase</B>&rdquo;) and obtained Shareholder Approval of the Authorized Share Increase and (B) obtained Shareholder Approval for
the Reverse Split, and shall have delivered evidence thereof (including, without limitation, evidence of the filing of relevant shareholders
resolutions with the Registrar of Companies in the Cayman Islands with respect to the Authorized Share Increase and the adoption of relevant
Board and shareholder resolutions approving the Authorized Share Increase and the Reverse Split) in form and substance reasonably satisfactory
to such Buyer..</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(ii) The
Company shall have duly executed and delivered to such Buyer each of the Transaction Documents to which it is a party and the Company
shall have delivered to such Buyer, on an expedited basis, evidence of the issuance of such Buyer&rsquo;s Shares hereunder as held in
DRS book-entry form by the Transfer Agent and registered in the name of such Buyer, or, at the election of such Buyer, a certificate evidencing
a number of Shares in such amounts as is set forth across from such Buyer&rsquo;s name in column (4) of the Schedule of Buyers as being
purchased by such Buyer at the Second Closing pursuant to this Agreement, registered in the name of such Buyer.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(iii) Such
Buyer shall have received the legal opinion of Han Kun Law Offices LLP, the Company&rsquo;s United States counsel, and of Maples and Calder
(Hong Kong) LLP, the Company&rsquo;s Cayman counsel, each dated as of the Second Closing Date, in the form acceptable to such Buyer.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(iv) The
Company shall have delivered to such Buyer (A) updated Irrevocable Transfer Agent Instructions (the &ldquo;<B>Second Closing Irrevocable
Transfer Agent Instructions</B>&rdquo;) covering all Shares outstanding after giving effect to the Second Closing (including the First
Closing Shares and the Second Closing Shares) and (B) a reservation / share reserve confirmation letter from the Transfer Agent (or other
written confirmation reasonably acceptable to the Lead Buyer) confirming that, as of the Second Closing Date, the Transfer Agent has reserved,
solely for the purpose of effecting conversions of the Shares, a number of Class A Ordinary Shares at least equal to the Required Reserve
Amount as of the Second Closing Date, calculated in accordance with Section 11(a) of the Certificate of Designations (based on the aggregate
Stated Value of all Shares then outstanding and the Floor Price then in effect). The items in clauses (A) and (B) shall be in form and
substance reasonably satisfactory to such Buyer, and the Second Closing Irrevocable Transfer Agent Instructions shall have been delivered
to and acknowledged in writing by the Transfer Agent.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(v) The
Company shall have delivered to such Buyer a certificate evidencing the formation and good standing of the Company in the Company&rsquo;s
jurisdiction of formation issued by the Registrar of Companies in the Cayman Islands (or comparable office) of such jurisdiction of formation
as of a date within ten (10) days of the Second Closing Date.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">(vi) [Reserved].</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 1in"></P>

